OL,3,GNEWSAI'm still in pain after being
OL,4,Apossessed by a ghost
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalloween may be over - but there are
OL,7,Fpeople in the West of England who spend
OL,8,Fthe whole year preoccupied with
OL,9,Fsuspected paranormal activity. We asked
OL,10,Fhow they first became interested in
OL,11,Fghosts - and spoke to an expert about
OL,12,Fwhat they believe could be behind
OL,13,Fparanormal experiences.
OL,15,FWhether you believe in ghosts or not -
OL,16,Fstories about them have captured the
OL,17,Fimagination for millennia.
